<title>USA: Archer Daniels Midland sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Archer Daniels Midland sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ill. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer Daniels Midland Co said Thursday its board of directors has declared a five percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable September 15 to shareholders of record August 18, the agribusiness giant said.  </p>
<p>Archer Daniels also said it declared a $0.05 a share quarterly dividend, payable Sept 2 to sharheolders of record August 8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
